title: "Vision-Obstacle-Avoidance-Robot"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and report of a B.Sc. project: a differential-drive wheeled mobile
  robot that drives to a goal pose and avoids obstacles using a camera, ultrasonic
  sensors and wheel odometry (Arduino Uno low-level control, Raspberry Pi high-level control).
